Hi, happy New Year!
Thanks everyone for playing The Chess Variants Club.

We've just released an update (v0.1.7) with these changes:

- Refinements in the menu system;
- Variant instructions available in-game;
- Puzzles: Changed Mate in 2 puzzle level 84 that had a problem and prevented progress to next level;
- Puzzles: Fixed bug on penultimate puzzle level that didn't move to next level when finished;
- Puzzles: Included message "All Levels completed" when the last puzzle level on the series is completed.

Thank you for your feedback and support!

Hi, thanks everyone for playing The Chess Variants Club.

We've just released an update (v0.1.4) with these changes:

- corrected: Reset eventually done wrongly on Atomic Chess;
- corrected: pieces eventually blown-up wrongly on Atomic Chess;
- avoided pieces movement during in-game Pause menu;
- reviewed achievement tracking.

Thank you for your feedback and support!

Hi, thanks everyone for playing The Chess Variants Club.

We've just released an update (v0.1.3) with these changes:

- design adjustment of king piece to better distinguish from queen;
- turn on signal when first entering the Puzzles screen;
- fixed Castling on  Chess 960 variant;
- removed improper Castling movement in Puzzles;

Thank you for your feedback and support!

Hi, thanks everyone for playing The Chess Variants Club.
We've just released an update (v0.1.1) with these changes:

- correct start of a new match in Microchess and Silverman (4x4);
- correction in five 3-Check puzzle levels that did not accept the solution  
- correction of one Demi-Chess puzzle level that was not check-mating in one move ;
- full text-scrolling in the variant information cards;
- restart button in puzzles menu;
- inclusion of version number.
- centralized studio logo in splash screen;
- treatment of the last puzzle of a series

We are listening to you and polishing the game!
Thank you for your feedback and support!

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/37117656/ab483049f9250714bffc5626ac4f6e19c0cb9d7d.jpg[/img]

Today is the day, my friends! 

Chess Knights: Viking Lands is ready for full release (and it is awesome!)

Here is the list of what is new:

- 17 new levels;
- The beautiful Ymir's Glaciers in all its glory (for the latest levels);
- Improvements in player control;
- Several visual improvements;
- New musics and sound effects;
- New UI tutorial for camera usage;
- Several minor changes and improvements;
- Northern Lights (\o/) 
- Minor bug-fixes.

You can play the full experience of [b]Chess Knights: Viking Lands[/b] today and also tell all your friends about it:

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1338980/Chess_Knights_Viking_Lands/

Have fun!
.
P.S.: Don't forget to follow our studio on Steam: 
https://store.steampowered.com/developer/Minimol

Today is the day! 

We are very happy to release the full version of Knights Retreat!

Thanks all of you so much for all the support for this little game. We couldn't ask for better players and followers. You guys rock!

Here is the list of what is new:

- 25 new levels;
- Entirely new game worlds (for the latest levels);
- Several visual improvements;
- New musics and sound effects;
- New UI tutorial for camera usage;
- Several minor changes and improvements;
- Minor bug-fixes.

You can play the full experience of Knight's Retreat today and also tell all your friends about it:

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1261700/Knights_Retreat/

Have fun!
.
P.S.: Don't forget to follow our studio on Steam: https://store.steampowered.com/developer/Minimol
